Date: Fri, 24 Jul 2026 08:29:26 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 5: PrivateFontCollection and InstalledFontCollection

Restores the two System.Drawing.Text font collections. FontCollection is
refactored to hold a font-family list that derived collections populate, and
Dispose now routes through Dispose(bool).

- PrivateFontCollection.AddFontFile records the font as a FontFamily so Families
  reflects it; AddMemoryFont is a documented no-op (needs native font APIs GTK
  lacks). Actually rendering a private font also requires fontconfig to see it -
  a documented deviation, matching the Pango/fontconfig-backable note in
  EMULATION-GAPS.md.
- InstalledFontCollection enumerates the Pango font map, degrading to an empty
  (never null) collection when no font map is available (headless), matching the
  always-usable WinForms contract.

Net48 System.Drawing types present 134->136. Drawing suite green at 1189, Forms
suite green at 2317 (+8 font tests: hierarchy, AddFontFile add/dedupe/null,
AddMemoryFont no-op, InstalledFontCollection non-null).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
